              "message": {
                "text": "<div data-animation=\"default\" data-collapse=\"all\" data-duration=\"400\" data-easing=\"ease\" data-easing2=\"ease\" role=\"banner\" class=\"navbar w-nav\"><div class=\"container is--navbar\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"navbar-logo__wrapper w-nav-brand\" aria-label=\"home\"><div class=\"logo-wrapper w-embed\"><canvas id=\"logo\" width=\"200\" height=\"60\"></canvas></div></a><div class=\"navbar-menu\" style=\"width: 449px;\"><div class=\"navbar-menu__content\"><div class=\"navbar-menu__list\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"navbar-link\">Home</a><a href=\"/product\" class=\"navbar-link\">Product</a><a href=\"/company\" class=\"navbar-link\">Company</a><a href=\"https://www.amazon.jobs/en/search?base_query=fauna\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navbar-link\">Careers</a><a href=\"/news\" class=\"navbar-link\">News</a></div><div class=\"navbar-menu__popup-trigger\"><div class=\"w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/693933367980a29f6ff36b6d/69775f291f66f1bbf54f4ab1_demo-poster.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/693933367980a29f6ff36b6d/69775f291f66f1bbf54f4ab1_demo-poster-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/693933367980a29f6ff36b6d/69775f291f66f1bbf54f4ab1_demo-poster-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/693933367980a29f6ff36b6d/69775f291f66f1bbf54f4ab1_demo-poster-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/693933367980a29f6ff36b6d/69775f291f66f1bbf54f4ab1_demo-poster-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/693933367980a29f6ff36b6d/69775f291f66f1bbf54f4ab1_demo-poster.webp 2340w\" class=\"absolute-cover is--cover\"><!--$--><button class=\"popup-trigger\"></button><!--/$--><div class=\"button-secondary button-large button-icon is--trigger is--navbar\"><div class=\"w-embed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\">\n  <path d=\"M16.589 8.37749C18.0631 9.11454 18.0631 11.2181 16.589 11.9552L6.39443 17.0525C5.06462 17.7174 3.5 16.7504 3.5 15.2636L3.5 5.06908C3.5 3.58231 5.06463 2.61532 6.39443 3.28022L16.589 8.37749Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path>\n</svg></div><div class=\"p-m\">Play video</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"navbar-menu__content-buttons\"><a href=\"https://form.typeform.com/to/HsZsaqmn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button-large button-primary w-inline-block\"><div>Request Robot</div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"navbar-buttons\"><div class=\"navbar-buttons__toggle\"><div class=\"navbar-menu__button morph-btn w-nav-button\" style=\"-webkit-user-select: text;\" aria-label=\"menu\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"w-nav-overlay-0\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><div class=\"navbar-menu__button-overlay btn-icon\"><div class=\"navbar-menu__button-line is--top\"></div><div class=\"navbar-menu__button-line is--bottom\"></div></div><div class=\"navbar-menu__button-fake\"><div>White papers</div><div class=\"embed-icon w-embed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\">\n  <path d=\"M4.14575 9.95801L14.9791 9.95801\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M9.979 4.125L15.8123 9.95833L9.979 15.7917\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path>\n</svg></div></div></div></div><div class=\"navbar-buttons__cta\"><a href=\"https://form.typeform.com/to/HsZsaqmn\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"button-large button-primary w-inline-block\"><div>Request Robot</div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"w-nav-overlay\" data-wf-ignore=\"\" id=\"w-nav-overlay-0\"></div></div> | Accessible name: \"HomeProductCompanyCareersNews Play videoRequest...\""
